                                              rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_60169> ;
                                              <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A phosphatidylinositol trisphosphate that is 1<small>D</small>-<i>myo</i>-inositol 1,4,5-trisphosphate in which all all six phosphate hydrogens have been replaced by butyryloxymethyl groups. It is a cell-permeant analogue of inositol 1,4,5-trisphosphate and an agonist of the inositol 1,4,5-trisphosphate receptor." ;
