                                                              <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_72790> ;
                                              <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A hydroxydocosahexaenoic acid that is (4<i>Z</i>,9<i>E</i>,11<i>E</i>,13<i>Z</i>,15<i>E</i>,19<i>Z</i>)-docosa-4,9,11,13,15,19-hexaenoic acid carrying an epoxy group at position 7<i>S</i> and a hydroxy group at position 17<i>R</i>. It is a metabolite of docosahexaenoic acid, and serves as a precursor to D-resolvins." ;
