                                                              <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_50995> ,
                                                              <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_51872> ;
                                              <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A pyrrolopyrimidine that is 7<em>H</em>-pyrrolo[2,3-<em>d</em>]pyrimidine which is substituted by a (1<i>S</i>)-2,3-dihydro-1<em>H</em>-inden-1-ylnitrilo group at position 4 and by a (1<i>S</i>,3<i>S</i>,4<i>S</i>)-3-hydroxy-4-[(sulfamoyloxy)methyl]cyclopentyl group at position 7. It is a potent and selective NEDD8-activating enzyme inhibitor with an IC<small><sub>50</sub></small> of 4.7 nM, and currently under clinical investigation for the treatment of acute myeloid leukemia (AML) and myelodysplastic syndromes." ;
