                                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_26255> ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Any napthoquinone that is substituted at position 2 by a prenyl or polyprenyl group. The term also includes compounds that are functionalised on the prenyl or polyprenyl chain (e.g. by a hydroxy group)." ;
                                             <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasOBONamespace> "chebi_ontology" ;
