                                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_60911> ,
                                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_77166> ;
                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A glucocorticoid steroid having a highly oxygenated pregna-1,4-diene structure. It is used mainly in the treatment of asthma and non-infectious rhinitis and for treatment and prevention of nasal polyposis." ;
