                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A disaccharide derivative that consists of  diosmetin substituted by a 6-<em>O</em>-(α-<small>L</small>-rhamnopyranosyl)-β-<small>D</small>-glucopyranosyl moiety at position 7 via a glycosidic linkage." ;
                                            <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasOBONamespace> "chebi_ontology" ;
