                                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_50860> ,
                                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_73474> ,
                                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_83565> ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A benzamide obtained by the formal condensation of the carboxy group of 3-(imidazo[1,2-<em>b</em>]pyridazin-3-ylethynyl)-4-methylbenzoic acid with the anilino group of 4-[(4-methylpiperazin-1-yl)methyl]-3-(trifluoromethyl)aniline. It is a multi-target tyrosine kinase inhibitor that targets ABL, SRC, FGFR, and others and was designed to overcome the resistance of BCR-ABL mutation to imatinib, in particular the gatekeeper mutation ABL<small><sup>T315I</small></sup>." ;
                                             <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasOBONamespace> "chebi_ontology" ;
