                                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_50401> ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Any of a family of steroid acids derived from sterols by oxidation with a cytochrome p450 that bind and activate the orphan nuclear receptor DAF-12 in the nematode <em>Caenorhabditis elegans</em>. Note that the singular term 'dafachronic acid' has been used as a synonym for the (non-natural) fully saturated (5α,25<i>S</i>)-3-oxocholestan-26-oic acid." ;
                                             <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasOBONamespace> "chebi_ontology" ;
